  "note": "v7 Glass theme (data-theme=\"glass\"): scenic liquid glass for the signed-in app and onboarding. Deep blurred colour scene (ambient-sky to ambient-ground plus coral, amber, blue and pink light), nearly clear panels (45% navy tint, 32px blur, bright rim and sheen), white ink, clear glass controls, warm-white primary. Builds on v6 ambient glass and the v5 taste pass; palette, type, components, motion and loyalty rules unchanged."
